            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi aggiungere un valore booleano a questo array che abbiamo definito sopra?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myArray: (\" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\")[];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Sì</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">No</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere No.</p></body></html>"
